{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 49","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/5/4f550db59d15933de1a0871aaa917acdd99966af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PAB$\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" /> is formed by three tangents to circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b2486d7ad8a988ffb8247a10a56e26e23e6aa8ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APB = 40^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />; then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f76e209ba6efb92105415d4f3c62ef804a52519d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AOB$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/b/f9b52a34eb763fe3d2be6be37911fa89577e7098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 45^{\\circ}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 50^{\\circ}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 55^{\\circ}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 60^{\\circ}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 70^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"435\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, from triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/890bd5d40a42153edcb992ad0a14cac52ca2eaf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABO$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/d/18d036b3e472ed5ea8aaf3d9c299bb62fb9542ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AOB = 180^\\circ - \\angle BAO - \\angle ABO$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"269\" height=\"13\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c53cc93aa43cc55bea0dc2511833fe6bdda020f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AO$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> bisects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/1/fb1bf10f8bdef51fa1c753719993f5c200b8cf46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAT$\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> (to see this, draw radii from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/4/bb4b08cd4583bc633f7cfa6c59fad145a4e19e77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AT,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" /> creating two congruent right triangles), so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/3/82307f32fd44fc8f93f4a0421b289d627ef5b3b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAO = \\angle BAT/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e0d364b3d2267f5ff9fe239a9f4b60ad5599462.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABO = \\angle ABR/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1e4e77b2bdf9173d12b152f7a6d069b7f099731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAT = 180^\\circ - \\angle BAP$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"190\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/7/0375db8a81b5a9997ed4e0ebfe18ec34f5a5d89f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABR = 180^\\circ - \\angle ABP$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"191\" height=\"13\" />. Hence, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/9/5d98f23bc43d325c5c14277b08ee7fa7ea1127cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AOB = 180^\\circ - \\angle BAO - \\angle ABO =  180^\\circ - \\frac{\\angle BAT}{2} - \\frac{\\angle ABR}{2} =  180^\\circ - \\frac{180^\\circ - \\angle BAP}{2} - \\frac{180^\\circ - \\angle ABP}{2}=   \\frac{\\angle BAP + \\angle ABP}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"996\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Finally, from triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7b510ddc7cf8a87b5cc0dd15adf8480cd2e6945.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/3/6e31da5394f1e1d251b6deacd2758b76537c49b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAP + \\angle ABP = 180^\\circ - \\angle APB = 180^\\circ - 40^\\circ = 140^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"434\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/e/cee158004b042523864b03663557cb88324d27c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle AOB = \\frac{\\angle BAP + \\angle ABP}{2} = \\frac{140^\\circ}{2} = \\boxed{70^\\circ}.\\]\" width=\"344\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=